              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 340,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Invest <b>€100,000</b> today</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Receive <b>€55,000</b> per year for 3 years</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Discount rate = <b>10%</b></p>",
